-```
-request:  {"op": "list_tools", "pattern": "macs*", "verify": true}
-response: {"tools": [{name, version, path, probe_status}], "source": "runtime"}
-```
-
-- `verify: false` —— 直接读 `/opt/agent-tools.json`（零开销）；
-- `verify: true`  —— 对匹配工具现跑 `which` + `--version` 复核，用于版本漂移场景；
