-### 题 9. DirectoryTree 的 DOM hack 与右键菜单
-
-**getElementById hack**（DirectoryTree.vue:76-108，完整关键段）：
-```ts
-function openCreateModal(parentPath: string) {
-  dialog.create({
-    title: '新建目录',
-    content: () =>
-      h('div', { style: 'padding: 8px 0' }, [
-        h('p', {...}, `父目录：${parentPath || '根目录'}`),
-        h('input', {
